{{Splblocknotes
| name = Static Field
| desc = Does not apply the on-hit affect upon the [[Spell Block]] source proc.
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Static Field
| desc = This ability only works with the following abilities: {{A|Zeus|Arc Lightning}}, {{A|Zeus|Lightning Bolt}}, {{A|Zeus|Heavenly Jump}}, {{A|Zeus|Nimbus}}, and {{A|Zeus|Thundergod's Wrath}}.
}}

 * This ability has two main components:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Spell Damage}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** Does not work with other abilities, including {{M|item}} abilities cast.
*** Applies the {{M|current health}} as {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} as bonus damage after the following abilities' respective [[spell damage]] component, under the following conditions:
**** {{A|Zeus|Arc Lightning}}
***** Applies the damage bonus per enemy unit per bounce.
**** {{A|Zeus|Lightning Bolt}}
***** Applies the damage bonus upon hit, regardless of the ability's targeting type utilized. 
***** The same applies to {{A|Zeus|Nimbus}}' Lightning Bolt.
**** {{A|Zeus|Heavenly Jump}}
***** Applies the damage bonus to the affected enemy unit(s) within its search radius.
**** {{A|Zeus|Thundergod's Wrath}}
***** Applies the damage bonus on all affected enemy heroes.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Attack Damage}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} 
*** For Zeus' successful attacks, the ability effects are applied as follows:
***# Applies the current health as damage value.
***# Zeus' attack instance.

* All ability effects do not affect the following units:
** {{M|Buildings}}
** {{M|Ward-type units}}.

* {{cf|expr}}
** {{Symbol|Damage|Magical}} {{M|Spell damage}} bonus: {{Code|EnemyCurrent[[Health|HP]] × ({{#var:Static Field value2}} + ({{#var:Static Field basic1}} × SelfLvl))}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Static Field icon0}}
| desc = Zeus shocks any enemy that he attacks or is hit by his abilities, causing damage equal to a percentage of their current health.
}}

