{{Stealnotes
| name = Nimbus
| desc = The {{U|Nimbus}} does not disappear upon losing the ability, but the unit stops casting {{A|Zeus|Lightning Bolt}}.<br><br>Reacquiring either the {{A|Zeus|Lightning Bolt}} or the {{A|Zeus|Nimbus}} abilities causes the unit to cast Lightning Bolt again.
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = Nimbus
| desc = Requires drafting {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{A|Zeus|Thundergod's Wrath}} to unlock this ability.<br>Requires drafting {{A|Zeus|Lightning Bolt}} for its corresponding component to work.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Nimbus icon0}}
| desc = Creates a storm cloud anywhere on the map that automatically casts Lightning Bolt on nearby enemies.
}}
* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** The visual effects indicating the Nimbus' radius are visible to everyone.

* A total of {{#expr:ceil({{#var:Nimbus value4}}/{{#var:Nimbus dt value1}})+1}} strikes may happen over the entire duration.

* Directly uses {{A|Zeus|Lightning Bolt}}'s ability values.  It does nothing if Lightning Bolt is not learned upon cast.

